geis
------------------------------------------
GEIS is a library for applications and toolkit programmers which provides a
consistent platform independent interface for any system-wide input gesture
recognition mechanism.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libX11_6-1.8.13-1
  libXext6-1.3.7-1
  libXi6-1.8.3-1
  libdbus1_3-1.16.2-1
  libframe6-2.5.0-1bl1
  libgeis-devel-2.2.17-1bl1
  libgeis1-2.2.17-1bl1
  libgrail6-3.1.1-1bl1
  libxcb1-1.17.0-2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  python3-3.12.12-1
  python3-geis-2.2.17-1bl1
  python312-3.12.12-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  check-0.15.2-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libX11-devel-1.8.13-1
  libXext-devel-1.3.7-1
  libXi-devel-1.8.3-1
  libdbus1-devel-1.16.2-1
  libframe-devel-2.5.0-1bl1
  libgrail-devel-3.1.1-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libxcb-devel-1.17.0-2
  make-4.4.1-2
  python3-3.12.12-1
  python3-devel-3.12.12-1
  xorg-server-devel-21.1.25-1
  xorgproto-2025.1-1

Canonical website:
  https://launchpad.net/geis

Canonical download:
  https://launchpad.net/geis/trunk/2.2.17/+download/geis-2.2.17.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack geis-2.2.17-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./geis-2.2.17-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/geis-2.2.17-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/geis-2.2.17-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgeis1-2.2.17-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libgeis-devel-2.2.17-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python3-geis-2.2.17-X.tar.xz

